  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 17a73f76e324318e5907c19d3b066f8c, type: 3}
  m_Name: PlaceTower
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: TowerDefence.Battlefield::TowerDefence.Battlefield.TutorialDefinition
  Id: PlaceTower
  Title: How to place a tower
  Pages:
  - Choose a tower, point at a compatible empty foundation, and press the right trigger
    to build. Preview colors show valid and occupied cells. Money is spent only for
    a valid placement.
  - In physical mode the panel hides when you choose a build item. You can move while
    placing. X opens the panel again.
